      "value": "I'm not sure if this means much, But i dont want to be banned if i gift a user an avatar who later gets banned for stupid reasons that are out of my own control. This seems a bit dodgy for the commissioners to get a ban for other people doing bad things with the models. I'm not liable for if someone else becomes an annoyance with my own work.",
